    "chunk_text": "\u00fean. Scortlice h\u00e6bbe we nu ges\u00e6d be \u00fe\u00e6m gesetenum iglandum \u00fee on \u00f0\u00e6m Wendels\u00e6 sindon. \u00c6r \u00f0\u00e6m \u00f0e Romeburh getimbred w\u00e6re \u00ferim hund wintra & \u00feusend wintra, Ninus, Asyria kyning, & mid ungem\u00e6tlicre gewilnunge anwaldes he w\u00e6s heriende & feohtende fiftig wintra, o\u00f0 he & hy \u00f0a under \u00f0\u00e6m \u00fee he him onwinnende w\u00e6s, wurdon gerade wigcr\u00e6fta, \u00feeah hi \u00e6r hyra lif And he Ninus Soroastrem Bactriana cyning, se cu\u00f0e manna \u00e6rest drycr\u00e6ftas, he hine oferwann & & \u00fea \u00e6t nyhstan he w\u00e6s feohtende wi\u00f0 Sci\u00f0\u00f0ie, on ane burh, & \u00fe\u00e6r wear\u00f0 ofscoten mid anre flane. & \u00e6fter his dea\u00f0e Sameramis his cwen fengc \u00e6g\u00feer ge to \u00fe\u00e6m gewinne ge to \u00fe\u00e6m rice. & hio \u00fe\u00e6t ylce gewin \u00fee hio hine on bespon mid manigfealdon firenlustum twa & feowertig wintra & hyre \u00feagyt to lytel \u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6s anwaldes \u00f0e se cyningc \u00e6r gewunnen h\u00e6fde, ac hio mid wiflice Sio gitsung \u00fea & \u00fea gewin w\u00e6ron grimlicran \u00feonne hy nu syn, for \u00f0on hy hyre nane bysene \u00e6r ne Seo ylce cwen Sameramis, sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t rice w\u00e6s on hyre gewealde, nales \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t hio \u00f0yrstende & \u00fea \u00e6t nehstan hyre agene sunu hio genam hyre to geligere; & for \u00f0on \u00fee hio hyre firenluste \ufffd",
